  clear - LY HIok ICok ILY PO LYa PEEK IGN SRD GL MKE CMI SMI CMS SMS CMSU SMSU VBI VBL PMODE HH AM K0 ENT FRM FRS FOK SP32 A10 A11 A12 CPRE INCS POK MP NB HB CRED KONT
          op ov oec ois osk otb WR G APART FF' l.

